/.lake

# Downloaded and built by install/get-eo-compiler.sh: the ethos source tree,
# ethos-eoc, and the compiler's staged output. What is kept in git instead is
# install/defs, the signature those compile.
/install/deps

# LaTeX build artifacts (see docs/Makefile)
docs/*.aux
docs/*.log
docs/*.out
docs/*.toc
docs/*.fls
docs/*.fdb_latexmk
docs/*.synctex.gz
# docs/smt-model-definitions.pdf is deliberately not ignored: the built PDF is
# committed so that it can be read without a LaTeX installation. Rebuild it
# with `make -C docs`.

# Working space, kept out of the tree rather than tidied out of it later:
# scratch output, and local notes written beside a document.
scratch/
*.local.md

# macOS directory metadata, which is not part of anything this repository ships.
.DS_Store
